# isLeaf

- _isLeaf(t)_

A `Tree` _t_ is a _leaf_ if its `size` is `zero`:

```
>>> Tree(1, []).isLeaf
true

>>> Tree(1, [Tree(2, [])]).isLeaf
false
```

* * *

See also: Tree, isTree, size, zero

